---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: About
description: About Jian, a software engineer and SRE in Melbourne.
permalink: /about/
---
<section class="about-grid">
  <div class="about-copy">
    <h1>Jian</h1>
    <p class="about-role">Site Reliability Engineer · Melbourne, Australia</p>
    <p>I am a Site Reliability Engineer based in Melbourne, at ANZ since 2023, where my work centres on automation and Google Cloud. Before that I taught software engineering at Monash University, from 2015 to 2019.</p>
    <p>Beyond my day-to-day work I am drawn to data visualisation, small public APIs, and software that stays simple by design. A few specifics:</p>
    <ul class="about-points">
      <li><strong>29 original repositories</strong> on GitHub since 2011: Malaysia API, a browser sentiment analyser, a D3 word cloud generator, and a Reddit r/AmItheAsshole crawler on a Raspberry Pi.</li>
      <li>Most recent project: <strong>Robogo</strong>, a YAML test-automation tool written in Go.</li>
      <li>Values readable configuration, static files over unnecessary databases, and clear writing.</li>
      <li>Not yet a Rust or Go specialist, though Robogo is making steady progress on the latter.</li>
      <li>Open to enquiries about reliability engineering, teaching, and data visualisation.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="about-section">Experience</h2>
    <ul class="about-history">
      {% for role in career.work %}
      <li class="hist-row">
        <span class="hist-dates">{{ role.dates }}</span>
        <span class="hist-body">
          <strong class="hist-title">{{ role.title }}</strong>
          <span class="hist-org">{{ role.org }}</span>
          {% if role.note %}<p class="hist-note">{{ role.note }}</p>{% endif %}
          {% if role.points %}
          <ul class="hist-points">
            {% for p in role.points %}<li>{{ p }}</li>{% endfor %}
          </ul>
          {% endif %}
        </span>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>

    <h2 class="about-section">Education</h2>
    <ul class="about-history">
      {% for ed in career.study %}
      <li class="hist-row">
        <span class="hist-dates">{{ ed.dates }}</span>
        <span class="hist-body">
          <strong class="hist-title">{{ ed.title }}</strong>
          <span class="hist-org">{{ ed.org }}</span>
          {% if ed.note %}<p class="hist-note">{{ ed.note }}</p>{% endif %}
          {% if ed.points %}
          <ul class="hist-points">
            {% for p in ed.points %}<li>{{ p }}</li>{% endfor %}
          </ul>
          {% endif %}
        </span>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>

    <h2 class="about-section">Certifications</h2>
    <ul class="about-history">
      {% for cert in career.certifications %}
      <li class="hist-row">
        <span class="hist-dates">{{ cert.dates }}</span>
        <span class="hist-body">
          <strong class="hist-title">{{ cert.title }}</strong>
          <span class="hist-org">{{ cert.org }}</span>
          {% if cert.note %}<p class="hist-note">{{ cert.note }}</p>{% endif %}
        </span>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>

    <div class="socials">
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
      <a href="{{ site.github }}">GitHub</a>
      <a href="{{ site.linkedin }}">LinkedIn</a>
      <a href="{{ site.kaggle }}">Kaggle</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
